{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35442","headline":"三年冬大礼五首 五 · 曹唐","name":"三年冬大礼五首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太和琴暖发南薰，水阔风高得细闻。\n沧海举歌夔是相，历山回禅舜爲君。\n翠微呼处生丹障，清静封中起白云。\n今日病身慙小隐，欲将泉石勒移文。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹唐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35442.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35442","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}